{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04090","headline":"秋夜寓直中书呈黄门舅 · 苏頲","name":"秋夜寓直中书呈黄门舅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帘栊上夜钩，清列听更筹。\n忽共鸡枝老，还如骑省秋。\n循庭喜三入，对渚忆双游。\n紫绂名初拜，黄缣迹尚留。\n月舒当北幌，云赋直东楼。\n恩渥迷天施，童蒙慰我求。\n迟君台鼎节，闻义一承流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}